---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site.js';
---

<Base title="about" breadcrumb="~/about">
  <h1>about</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      i'm moe p. wellington, a 31-year-old artist from germany. since 2022,
      i've been experimenting with AI.
    </p>
    <p>
      my work explores the paradox between UI and AI: interfaces are systems
      designed to be read and understood by humans, yet i ask artificial models
      to reconstruct their visual language without access to the logic,
      intention, or literacy those interfaces were built to communicate.
    </p>
    <p>
      what emerges is a kind of false memory of software. worlds that appear
      functional and navigable, but refuse to fully explain themselves.
    </p>
    <p>
      i'm interested in the sensation of encountering videogames as a child,
      before their symbols had settled into meaning: when something could feel
      familiar and operational long before i understood how to read it.
    </p>
    <p>
      i use AI because it recreates that same feeling: a system that seems to
      work, but begins to fall apart the closer you look.
    </p>
    <p>information before literacy. systems before understanding.</p>

    <h2>contact</h2>
    <p>no contact form here. find me on:</p>
    <ul>
      {SITE.socials.map((s) => (
        <li><a href={s.href} rel="me noopener">{s.label}</a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
